{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After you damage an enemy, spawn a pool of blood that deals {c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_DAMAGE}{/c} Bleeding damage per second over {c_number}{SF_0}{/c} seconds. You can have up to {c_number}{SF_3}{/c} active pools.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power Heals you for {c_random}[{SF_8}*100|1%|]{/c} of your Maximum Life over {c_number}3{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
